===Etymology===
Unclear, but likely from {{der|en|kw|porth||harbor}} + {{m|kw|bugel||shepherd}}, with the latter element either influenced by {{noncog|en|beagle}} or in fact formed from it, with only the first element truly being from Cornish.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}
[[Image:Lanas u0.gif|right|thumb|A '''porbeagle'''.]]

# A large [[pelagic]] predatory [[shark]], ''[[Lamna nasus]]'', of the [[Atlantic]].

